## ✅ 給你的最終建議

**推薦組合論文結構**:

```
Identification (Week 5-6):
  - DAG: Local vs Central，控制variables
  - Assumption: Selection on observables (unconfoundedness)
  - 圖: Overlap check

Baseline (Week 4):
  - DiD: 確認Balán的3.2pp

Main Analysis (Week 7-11, 選一個):
  
  【OPTION A - 最有故事性】
  Angle 1: 酋長知識質量 → CLI效果異質性
  - Week 8: X-learner估計 τ̂(x | chief_knowledge_quartile)
  - Week 11: Causal forest顯示interaction
  
  【OPTION B - 最mechanical】
  Angle 3: Collector能力 × 酋長知識
  - Week 8: T-learner或X-learner
  - Stratify by collector education × chief knowledge
  - Week 10: DML給exact inference
```

**核心**: 選一個，然後把Week 7-11所有方法都用上。
論文目標是展示你會用**所有課程工具**，不只是一個。
